details:
To reproduce;  

Make a non-humanoid bone on your avatar (ie;  Not one that's Rigged.  A hair, or something).  Put a Contact Receiver in an empty transform.  It can be a child of the bone, or elsewhere, but must target the bone as its root transform.

Change the scaling of it in-game, along with the scaling of your avatar.  The position will now be offset.

